&_nc_oc=AdpjcXkrZQjhY7AFaXJp3m6-4BDPyEe2ZDqDWTQ_s8X-KvBI1mgHcauWajSnxeLl1WI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAgjr43UyWgPrd_1cqef_6Lt5boeSnFUaU6wfNczEVY0A&oe=6A67763E"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OxPAOx1puFAQ7kNvwGa9RIc&_nc_oc=AdojUS62exvn0uMWj104EubjewYAusfHSwP7T8jmM7xmRt5yzlXK-ehn-AYy1D9uXcQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQD02XgXOGnyn9eoCoUcp5xcZ3IHzVeXQMm1Gm_5WmP1Rw&oe=6A674EFC"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uJhjm9nDyo4Q7kNvwHNRlfG&_nc_oc=AdoIQay2-ipt0zlV_bCancq7FAE8w4vrwW5FDVPrlGL_BDs7MQhkmPMduXTkHcJKTQ0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBjYT_vpTBHuelfSjwBduQTSLq7QulqbN4m0sq9lstRPA&oe=6A676D87"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KJEAXVcQswwQ7kNvwFOH8jz&_nc_oc=Adr_jjo3tngXQa-JmRVm48Nb0ThZuUuDvJfIjKOFWHV3bv-aBK7cjhv4Q9PNHkzAUm4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQD-TsYQNwlvB4d6Ix2yqqmdxQrdtJ8ZR6KeNTqF2ppn2Q&oe=6A675955"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yRoOn9moeFYQ7kNvwF87w36&_nc_oc=AdrsT5Lh-71Zp0z4V-1AMVIXtdLPqhchmt6uyfK61LjiUNuBi4DkNGHn30jhIu61YSE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBoI9AhADWA31fOL3et9_dRW03sLt2OKUcWfKpP1r_jVw&oe=6A6765E4"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.